{"file":"XYO & XYO Layer 1 (XL1) Integration-1.1.35-v2.zip","bytes":292023,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"xyo-skills","description":"XYO and XL1 agent skills for building dApps on the XL1 blockchain. Covers XYO primitives, XL1 chain operations, scaffold tooling, testing, and prescriptive design patterns. Requires companion ariestools-skills for xy-development and xy-toolchain.","version":"1.1.35","license":"LGPL-3.0-only","repository":"https://github.com/XYOracleNetwork/xyo-skills","homepage":"https://github.com/XYOracleNetwork/xyo-skills","keywords":["xl1","xyo","blockchain","dapp","typescript"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/xl1-build/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-build","description":"Interactive planning wizard for new XL1 dApps. Refines a vague or exploratory build request into a concrete spec (archetype, patterns, network, multi-party roles, headless verification) before any scaffolding runs. Activates when the user wants to build, design, or plan something on XL1 but hasn't fully specified what — phrases like \"I want to build something on XL1\", \"help me design a dApp\", \"what could I build\", or any \"build me X on XL1\" prompt where X is under-specified. Do NOT activate when the user has already given a concrete, complete spec (e.g., names the archetype, the patterns, the network) — defer directly to [xl1-scaffold](../xl1-scaffold/SKILL.md) in that case.","headings":["XL1 Build Wizard","When this skill activates","How to run the wizard","Phase 1 — Identify the archetype","Phase 2 — Refine details for the chosen archetype","Phase 3 — Capture the environment","Phase 4 — Synthesize the refined prompt and hand off","<one-line goal derived from Shape — e.g. \"Two-player rock-paper-scissors with sealed moves\">","Build target","Acceptance criteria","Layer 1 — Generic DoD","Layer 2 — Domain DoD","Layer 3 — Project-specific criteria","Skills referenced","Plugin version","Notes","What the wizard does **not** do","Anti-patterns"],"name_hint":"xl1 · 构建","description_zh":"为需求尚不明确的新XL1去中心化应用提供交互规划，在搭建前明确应用类型、模式、网络、多方角色和无界面验证规格；已有完整规格时直接进入脚手架流程。"},{"path":"skills/xl1-dapp-kit/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-dapp-kit","description":"Portable headless XL1 dApp architecture via @xyo-network/dapp-kit*. Covers definition/config/plan/incarnation, xl1.dapp.json, application ports, effect journals and crash recovery, durable events vs Event Kit wakes, Node/browser hosts, Vercel/Cloudflare target composition, and conformance evidence. Also holds the architecture principles for any multi-party XL1 dApp (engine vs clients, evidence-derived state, written protocol, house role, constant-cost indexed loads, verifiable indexes). Activates when designing or reviewing an XL1 dApp's architecture, building or migrating toward dapp-kit, writing xl1.dapp.json, hosting a headless runtime, or distinguishing UI clients from the protocol application. Complements xl1-patterns domain recipes and xl1-scaffold React+service apps — does not replace gateway/chain knowledge.","headings":["XL1 dApp Kit","Lower layers","Table of Contents","[Architecture principles](architecture-principles.md)","[Vocabulary](vocabulary.md)","[Project manifest](project-manifest.md)","[Effects and recovery](effects-and-recovery.md)","[Application ports](application-ports.md)","[Events and wakes](events-and-wakes.md)","[Hosting and targets](hosting.md)","[Conformance](conformance.md)"],"name_hint":"xl1 · dapp · kit","description_zh":"设计和评审基于@xyo-network/dapp-kit的可移植无界面XL1应用架构，涵盖定义配置计划、xl1.dapp.json、应用接口、效果日志与崩溃恢复、持久事件、Node和浏览器宿主、Vercel及Cloudflare部署组合和一致性证据，并区分协议引擎与UI客户端。"},{"path":"skills/xl1-knowledge/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-knowledge","description":"XL1 blockchain development (XYO Layer One). Covers the XL1 chain, datalakes, gateway (generic, browser, and Node — including FinalizedBlockStream), website integration via @xyo-network/xl1-browser-system and the REST-over-RPC transport rule, identity, and pointers to application substrates (Statement Graph, dapp-kit). Activates when building on XL1, integrating XL1 into a website, working with @xyo-network/xl1-* packages, or developing blockchain-backed applications.","headings":["XL1 Blockchain Knowledge","Lower Layer Skills","Payload schema and identity rules","Critical: Never Issue Raw RPC Calls","Table of Contents","[XL1 Chain](chain.md)","[Development on XL1](development.md)","[Identity & Wallets](identity.md)","[Datalakes](datalakes.md)","[Gateway](gateway.md)","[Browser Gateway](gateway-browser.md)","[Node Gateway](gateway-node.md)","Application substrates (not core chain)"],"name_hint":"xl1 · 知识","description_zh":"提供XYO Layer One区块链开发知识，涵盖链、数据湖、通用及浏览器和Node网关、FinalizedBlockStream、网站集成、REST-over-RPC传输规则、身份及Statement Graph和dapp-kit应用基础。"},{"path":"skills/xl1-patterns/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-patterns","description":"Prescriptive design patterns for XL1 dApps. Covers browser UX, chain data indexing, commit-reveal schemes, in-page datalakes, prediction markets, atomic exchange (multi-party escrow), inscription substrates, fungible tokens, Statement Graph relationship claims, and Event Kit authenticated wake delivery. Activates when building application-level features on XL1 that require structured data access, multi-party fairness, atomic asset exchange, client-side chain queries, ownable artifacts, token protocols, signed relationship graphs, wallet-JWT wakes, or dApp UI conventions. (Testing and headless verification now live in the xl1-testing skill. Headless application contracts live in xl1-dapp-kit.)","headings":["XL1 Design Patterns","Lower Layer Skills","Payload schema and hash prerequisites","Table of Contents","[Browser UX](browser-ux.md)","[Wallet](wallet.md)","[Browser ↔ Service Wiring](browser-service-wiring.md)","Chain Data Indexing — by role","[Commit-Reveal Primitive](commit-reveal.md)","[In-Page Data Lakes](in-page-datalakes.md)","[Commit-Reveal Prediction Markets](commit-reveal-prediction-markets.md)","[Atomic Exchange](atomic-exchange.md)","[Inscription Substrate](inscription-substrate.md)","[Fungible Tokens (XRC-20)](fungible-tokens.md)","[Statement Graph](statement-graph.md)","[Authenticated Wake Delivery](authenticated-wake-delivery.md)","Headless verification → moved to [xl1-testing](../xl1-testing/SKILL.md)","[dApp Definition of Done](dapp-checklist.md)"],"name_hint":"xl1 · patterns","description_zh":"提供XL1应用设计模式，涵盖浏览器体验、链数据索引、提交揭示、多方托管交换、预测市场、页内数据湖、铭文与代币、签名关系声明图和认证事件唤醒；测试及无界面应用契约由独立技能处理。"},{"path":"skills/xl1-scaffold/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-scaffold","description":"Bootstrap a new XL1 application — a single React dApp, a single xl1-service backend, a plain Node.js service/CLI, or a full-stack pnpm monorepo with React + xl1-service + a shared TypeScript library. Activates when the user wants to create, start, bootstrap, initialize, or scaffold a new XL1 project. Do NOT activate for work in an existing project.","headings":["XL1 Scaffold","How to recognize the trigger","Interpreting the prompt","PRD.md fallback (read)","Writing PRD.md from an inline prompt (advanced-user path)","Invocation","Choosing template(s)","Target directory","Run the scaffold","1. Workspace root (no install — verification skipped, root has no installable code yet).","The root's package.json `name` field is the dir's basename (e.g. `rps-game`); sub-","package scopes auto-derive from this (sub-packages become `@rps-game/<basename>`).","2. Sub-packages — each runs in workspace-member mode (skips its own install + verification;","drops its own packageManager + .gitignore; package name becomes @<scope>/<basename>).","Order matters: scaffold shared FIRST. When app and service are scaffolded after,","they auto-detect the sibling shared package and wire a \"@<scope>/shared\": \"workspace:*\"","dep into their package.json automatically.","3. Single install at the workspace root — links all members + installs deps for all."],"name_hint":"xl1 · scaffold","description_zh":"为新XL1项目生成脚手架，可创建React应用、xl1-service后端、Node服务或CLI，以及含共享TypeScript库的全栈pnpm仓库；不用于既有项目修改。"},{"path":"skills/xl1-testing/SKILL.md","name":"xl1-testing","description":"How to test and verify XL1 work — choosing and running the right verification approach. Groups headless verification methods: Sequence testnet verification (in-process seed-phrase signer), local dev-chain verification (public xl1 CLI or vitest-owned chains via public @xyo-network/dapp-kit-vitest-config local-xl1, or XYO-internal @xyo-network/xl1-vitest-config apiLocal), composed local chain + Aries data-store verification, full local dApp backend verification (aries-dapp-core classic path or dapp-kit local path), unattended Sequence testing via @xyo-network/wallet-xl1-cli, and headless browser-mode testing (vitest + Playwright). Includes shared testnet-only safety rules. Activates when an agent needs to test, verify, or smoke-test an XL1 dApp or protocol change, run on-chain tests against a local chain or Sequence, run headless browser tests, or set up unattended / CI testing.","headings":["XL1 Testing","Lower-layer skills","⛔ Testnet-only by default","Choose an approach","Local chain boot — pick one","Application composition — pick one","Headless verification methods","Cross-References"],"name_hint":"xl1 · testing","description_zh":"选择并运行XL1验证方式，包括Sequence测试网、本地开发链、链与Aries数据存储组合、完整本地应用后端、无人值守钱包CLI及Vitest和Playwright无界面浏览器测试，并遵循仅测试网的共同安全规则。"},{"path":"skills/xy-development/SKILL.md","name":"xy-development","description":"REDIRECT ONLY. Canonical xy-development lives in ariestools/ariestools-skills. Install that pack and read its xy-development skill for TypeScript conventions, Git workflow, testing principles, and the definition of done. This xyo-skills copy is a temporary redirect stub — do not use it as documentation.","headings":["Development Standards — moved","Required action","Why this stub exists"],"name_hint":"xy · development","description_zh":"仅为重定向占位：xy-development的正式文档位于ariestools/ariestools-skills，涵盖TypeScript规范、Git流程、测试原则和完成标准；本副本不能作为实际开发文档使用。"},{"path":"skills/xy-toolchain/SKILL.md","name":"xy-toolchain","description":"REDIRECT ONLY. Canonical xy-toolchain lives in ariestools/ariestools-skills. Install that pack and read its xy-toolchain skill for @ariestools/toolchain, the xy CLI, ESLint flat configs, TypeScript configs, Vitest, deplint, repository policy, skills, and work tracking. This xyo-skills copy is a temporary redirect stub — do not use it as documentation.","headings":["XY Toolchain — moved","Required action","Why this stub exists"],"name_hint":"xy · toolchain","description_zh":"仅为重定向占位：xy-toolchain的正式文档位于ariestools/ariestools-skills，涵盖工具链、xy CLI、ESLint、TypeScript、Vitest、deplint、仓库规则及工作跟踪；本副本不能作为实际工具链文档使用。"},{"path":"skills/xyo-knowledge/SKILL.md","name":"xyo-knowledge","description":"XYO Protocol 2.0 domain knowledge. Covers payloads, bound witnesses, schemas, the module system (archivist, diviner, witness, sentinel, node), accounts, wallets, and protocol best practices. Activates when building on XYO or working with @xyo-network packages.","headings":["XYO Protocol Knowledge","Table of Contents","[Protocol Primitives](primitives.md)","[Payload Schema Evolution and Identity](payload-schema-evolution.md)","[Module System](modules.md)","[Identity & Signing](identity.md)","[Protocol Best Practices](best-practices.md)"],"name_hint":"xyo · 知识","description_zh":"提供XYO Protocol 2.0领域知识，涵盖载荷、绑定见证、schema、archivist/diviner/witness/sentinel/node模块、账号、钱包和协议实践，用于XYO及@xyo-network包开发。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["xyo-claude-plugin","Install","Claude Code CLI","Claude Desktop app","Team setup (`.claude/settings.json`)","Other distributions","License"]},{"path":"skills/xl1-scaffold/scripts/scaffold/README.md","headings":["xl1-scaffold/scripts/scaffold/ — generated"]},{"path":"skills/xl1-scaffold/scripts/scaffold/templates/xl1-monorepo/README.md","headings":["XL1 monorepo","Workspace dependencies","Common commands (run from this root)","Browser ↔ service wiring"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".cl